WEBVTT

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:02.018
But all these efforts at nation-building

00:01:02.042 --> 00:01:04.268
do not go to the heart of the matter.

00:01:04.292 --> 00:01:05.559
Which is this:

00:01:05.583 --> 00:01:08.434
we cannot build what we do not truly love.

00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:12.434
And we cannot love
until we love ourselves.

00:01:12.458 --> 00:01:14.893
The thing we have to heal, us Kenyans,

00:01:14.917 --> 00:01:16.601
is our lack of self-love,

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:18.643
our deep self-hate

00:01:18.667 --> 00:01:21.893
and our existential identity crisis.

00:01:21.917 --> 00:01:24.434
And this is the work of nation-building

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:27.042
that only the creative industry can do.

00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:31.351
The idea that Kenya
can only include some of us